Ditto.

> +	if (file->final_fname[0] == '|') {
> +		/* pipe mode */
> +		FILE *pipe;
> +		/* clearing */
> +		file->final_fname[0] = ' ';
> +		pipe = popen(file->final_fname, "w");

Pass "file->final_fname + 1", and you don't have to replace the pipe
with a space.


